       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose looks unsafe.\n\nAcetaminophen 3000 mg three times daily comes to **9,000 mg/day**. That is more than double the usual adult maximum of 4,000 mg/day, and 3,000 mg is three times the usual single dose of 1,000 mg. At that level there is a serious risk of hepatotoxicity, even with normal liver function.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **1000 mg PO three times daily** (3,000 mg/day total)\n- **650 mg PO every 6 hours** (2,600 mg/day total)\n- **1000 mg PO every 8 hours**, or four times daily at most (4,000 mg/day)\n\nTell me the dose and frequency you want and I'll enter it. If you do want 3000 mg three times daily, please confirm that. I'd still suggest checking it with pharmacy first."
